; ScalpMaster_Pro Moderate — RiskPerTradePct=0.5, MinRR=1.2, EA defaults
; Scope: XAU/XAG + EURUSD+ only, US30 out of scope. Sessions in GMT (=UTC), EA defaults:
; London 07-10 GMT / NY 13-16 GMT
; NOTE: EA has NO trend-filter bool and NO ScalpMode bool.
